0..69 Comment "// A flow between function types, after directed univalence (Gratzer,"
70..147 Comment "// Weinberger and Buchholtz, _Directed univalence in simplicial homotopy type"
148..226 Comment "// theory_, arXiv:2407.09146): a flow from the old schema to the new, given by"
227..303 Comment "// its translator, turns a reader of the new schema into a reader of the old"
304..369 Comment "// one, contravariant in the argument and constant in the result."
371..446 Comment "/// A record schema with its fields swapped, the reader of its ages carried"
447..492 Comment "/// back to the old schema along the upgrade."
